# Lessons

## User Specified Lessons

- You have a python venv in ./venv (create if needed). Check `which uv` first; if available use `uv pip install`, else `pip`.
- For multiline commit messages, write the message to a file and use `git commit -F <filename>`, then delete the file. Include "[Cursor] " in commit messages and PR titles.

## Cursor learned

- This repo (GigaLearnCPP) was developed on MSVC; GCC builds need care (Timer clock mismatch, typeid mangling).
- libtorch 2.x requires CMake >= 3.18 and C++17+; repo uses C++20.
- `configure_file(... COPY)` is invalid CMake; must be `COPYONLY`.
- `torch::tensor(std::vector<T>)` is slow for big vectors; prefer `torch::from_blob(...).clone()`.
- index_copy_ in libtorch requires kLong (int64) index tensors.
- GCC `typeid().name()` returns mangled names; use `abi::__cxa_demangle` for readable reward names.
- CPU-only libtorch download: https://download.pytorch.org/libtorch/cpu/libtorch-cxx11-abi-shared-with-deps-<ver>%2Bcpu.zip

# Scratchpad

## Task: Improve GigaLearnCPP (bugs, speed, docs, setup, roadmap) - branch cursor/improve-gigalearn-e1ff

### Confirmed bugs (from code audit)
[ ] GAE.cpp: truncated val preds consumed in reverse order (backward loop, forward-stored)
[ ] GAE.cpp: OOB read `_valPreds[step+1]` on last step
[ ] PPOLearner::Learn: overbatch tail silently dropped (GPU + CPU paths)
[ ] BatchedWelfordStat::ReadFromJSON reads "mean"/"var" but ToJSON writes "means"/"vars" -> crash on load w/ standardizeObs
[ ] Learner.cpp reward sampling: uses lastRewards[i] instead of [arenaIdx]; OOB on empty lastRewards
[ ] EnvSet ctor: arenas pushed in thread completion order but userInfo->arenaIdx = creation idx -> event misattribution
[ ] EnvSet ctor: heatseeker pushes NULL into eventCallbackInfos twice
[ ] EnvSet::ResetArena: userInfo set on local copy after assignment -> gameStates userInfo always NULL
[ ] Learner obs-standardize: RS_MAX should be RS_MIN (maxObsSamples is a cap)
[ ] Deterministic mode in training: promised exception missing -> OOB crash instead
[ ] ComputeEntropy maskEntropy: div by log(1)=0 when 1 valid action
[ ] Timer.h: steady_clock time_point assigned from high_resolution_clock::now() -> GCC compile error
[ ] Report::Display list: missing comma joins "-PPO Learn Time" + "" (also wrong key names in display list)
[ ] DefaultAction: off-by-one `i > numGroundActions` (first air action permanently masked)
[ ] DefaultAction: boost-mask removal before jump-mask add re-enables boost actions at 0 boost
[ ] Reward::GetName: mangled names on GCC (demangle)
[ ] trainAgainstOldVersions: stale partial trajectories corrupt when player recording set changes
[ ] KeyPressDetector: EOF -> busy spin in headless envs
[ ] Truncation next-states not standardized when standardizeObs enabled
[ ] index tensors must be kLong for index_copy_ (train-against-old path)
[ ] MagSGD: div-by-zero when gradMag == 0
[ ] PolicyVersionManager: skill env leaks replaced setters/conds/rewards
[ ] CMake: configure_file COPY -> COPYONLY, libsrc glob typo, deprecated FindPythonLibs

### Perf improvements
[ ] Learn(): accumulate metrics as tensors, single GPU sync per iteration (was ~8 .item() syncs per minibatch)
[ ] NaN obs scan -> vectorizable double-sum check w/ detailed scan only on failure
[ ] DIMLIST2_TO_TENSOR / VEC_TO_TENSOR via from_blob+clone (memcpy) instead of elementwise torch::tensor
[ ] Avoid GetRow() temporary allocs in hot loop (AppendRowTo)
[ ] Trajectory reserve() to reduce reallocs
[ ] ExperienceBuffer: single shuffled kLong index tensor, narrow() per batch

### Features / roadmap
[ ] Finish "training against older versions" (fix corruption; README roadmap item)
[ ] Advantage normalization option (standard PPO trick)
[ ] Metric fallback: no wandb -> local JSONL logger instead of crash
[ ] sys.path fix so python_scripts import works regardless of CWD

